#: ../../source/templates_sanity.md:16
msgid "1. Visual Theme & Atmosphere"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sanity.md:18
msgid ""
"Sanity's website is a developer-content platform rendered as a nocturnal "
"command center -- dark, precise, and deeply structured. The entire "
"experience sits on a near-black canvas (`#0b0b0b`) that reads less like a"
" \"dark mode toggle\" and more like the natural state of a tool built for"
" people who live in terminals. Where most CMS marketing pages reach for "
"friendly pastels and soft illustration, Sanity leans into the gravity of "
"its own product: structured content deserves a structured stage."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sanity.md:20
msgid ""
"The signature typographic voice is waldenburgNormal -- a distinctive, "
"slightly geometric sans-serif with tight negative letter-spacing (-0.32px"
" to -4.48px at display sizes) that gives headlines a compressed, "
"engineered quality. At 112px hero scale with -4.48px tracking, the type "
"feels almost machined -- like precision-cut steel letterforms. This is "
"paired with IBM Plex Mono for code and technical labels, creating a dual-"
"register voice: editorial authority meets developer credibility."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sanity.md:22
msgid ""
"What makes Sanity distinctive is the interplay between its monochromatic "
"dark palette and vivid, saturated accent punctuation. The neutral scale "
"runs from pure black through a tightly controlled gray ramp (`#0b0b0b` ->"
" `#212121` -> `#353535` -> `#797979` -> `#b9b9b9` -> `#ededed` -> "
"`#ffffff`) with no warm or cool bias -- just pure, achromatic precision. "
"Against this disciplined backdrop, a neon green accent (display-p3 green)"
" and electric blue (`#0052ef`) land with the impact of signal lights in a"
" dark control room. The orange-red CTA (`#f36458`) provides the only warm"
" touch in an otherwise cool system."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sanity.md:24
msgid "**Key Characteristics:**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sanity.md:25
msgid ""
"Near-black canvas (`#0b0b0b`) as the default, natural environment -- not "
"a dark \"mode\" but the primary identity"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sanity.md:26
msgid ""
"waldenburgNormal with extreme negative tracking at display sizes, "
"creating a precision-engineered typographic voice"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sanity.md:27
msgid ""
"Pure achromatic gray scale -- no warm or cool undertones, pure neutral "
"discipline"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sanity.md:28
msgid ""
"Vivid accent punctuation: neon green, electric blue (`#0052ef`), and "
"coral-red (`#f36458`) against the dark field"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sanity.md:29
msgid ""
"Pill-shaped primary buttons (99999px radius) contrasting with subtle "
"rounded rectangles (3-6px) for secondary actions"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sanity.md:30
msgid "IBM Plex Mono as the technical counterweight to the editorial display face"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sanity.md:31
msgid ""
"Full-bleed dark sections with content contained in measured max-width "
"containers"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sanity.md:32
msgid ""
"Hover states that shift to electric blue (`#0052ef`) across all "
"interactive elements -- a consistent \"activation\" signal"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sanity.md:34
msgid "2. Color Palette & Roles"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sanity.md:36
msgid "Primary Brand"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sanity.md:37
msgid ""
"**Sanity Black** (`#0b0b0b`): The primary canvas and dominant surface "
"color. Not pure black but close enough to feel absolute. The foundation "
"of the entire visual identity."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sanity.md:38
msgid ""
"**Pure Black** (`#000000`): Used for maximum-contrast moments, deep "
"overlays, and certain border accents."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sanity.md:39
msgid ""
"**Sanity Red** (`#f36458`): The primary CTA and brand accent -- a warm "
"coral-red that serves as the main call-to-action color. Used for \"Get "
"Started\" buttons and primary conversion points."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sanity.md:41
msgid "Accent & Interactive"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sanity.md:42
msgid ""
"**Electric Blue** (`#0052ef`): The universal hover/active state color "
"across the entire system. Buttons, links, and interactive elements all "
"shift to this blue on hover. Also used as `--color-blue-700` for focus "
"rings and active states."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sanity.md:43
msgid ""
"**Light Blue** (`#55beff` / `#afe3ff`): Secondary blue variants used for "
"accent backgrounds, badges, and dimmed blue surfaces."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sanity.md:44
msgid ""
"**Neon Green** (`color(display-p3 .270588 1 0)`): A vivid, wide-gamut "
"green used as `--color-fg-accent-green` for success states and premium "
"feature highlights. Falls back to `#19d600` in sRGB."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sanity.md:45
msgid ""
"**Accent Magenta** (`color(display-p3 .960784 0 1)`): A vivid wide-gamut "
"magenta for specialized accent moments."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sanity.md:47
msgid "Surface & Background"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sanity.md:48
msgid "**Near Black** (`#0b0b0b`): Default page background and primary surface."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sanity.md:49
msgid ""
"**Dark Gray** (`#212121`): Elevated surface color for cards, secondary "
"containers, input backgrounds, and subtle layering above the base canvas."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sanity.md:50
msgid ""
"**Medium Dark** (`#353535`): Tertiary surface and border color for "
"creating depth between dark layers."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sanity.md:51
msgid ""
"**Pure White** (`#ffffff`): Used for inverted sections, light-on-dark "
"text, and specific button surfaces."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sanity.md:52
msgid ""
"**Light Gray** (`#ededed`): Light surface for inverted/light sections and"
" subtle background tints."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sanity.md:54
msgid "Neutrals & Text"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sanity.md:55
msgid ""
"**White** (`#ffffff`): Primary text color on dark surfaces, maximum "
"legibility."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sanity.md:56
msgid ""
"**Silver** (`#b9b9b9`): Secondary text, body copy on dark surfaces, muted"
" descriptions, and placeholder text."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sanity.md:57
msgid ""
"**Medium Gray** (`#797979`): Tertiary text, metadata, timestamps, and de-"
"emphasized content."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sanity.md:58
msgid "**Charcoal** (`#212121`): Text on light/inverted surfaces."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sanity.md:59
msgid ""
"**Near Black Text** (`#0b0b0b`): Primary text on white/light button "
"surfaces."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sanity.md:61
msgid "Semantic"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sanity.md:62
msgid ""
"**Error Red** (`#dd0000`): Destructive actions, validation errors, and "
"critical warnings -- a pure, high-saturation red."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sanity.md:63
msgid "**GPC Green** (`#37cd84`): Privacy/compliance indicator green."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sanity.md:64
msgid ""
"**Focus Ring Blue** (`#0052ef`): Focus ring color for accessibility, "
"matching the interactive blue."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sanity.md:66
msgid "Border System"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sanity.md:67
msgid ""
"**Dark Border** (`#0b0b0b`): Primary border on dark containers -- barely "
"visible, maintaining minimal containment."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sanity.md:68
msgid ""
"**Subtle Border** (`#212121`): Standard border for inputs, textareas, and"
" card edges on dark surfaces."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sanity.md:69
msgid ""
"**Medium Border** (`#353535`): More visible borders for emphasized "
"containment and dividers."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sanity.md:70
msgid ""
"**Light Border** (`#ffffff`): Border on inverted/light elements or "
"buttons needing contrast separation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sanity.md:71
msgid ""
"**Orange Border** (`color(display-p3 1 0.3333 0)`): Special accent border"
" for highlighted/featured elements."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sanity.md:73
msgid "3. Typography Rules"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sanity.md:75
msgid "Font Family"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sanity.md:76
msgid ""
"**Display / Headline**: `waldenburgNormal`, fallback: `waldenburgNormal "
"Fallback, ui-sans-serif, system-ui`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sanity.md:77
msgid ""
"**Body / UI**: `waldenburgNormal`, fallback: `waldenburgNormal Fallback, "
"ui-sans-serif, system-ui`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sanity.md:78
msgid ""
"**Code / Technical**: `IBM Plex Mono`, fallback: `ibmPlexMono Fallback, "
"ui-monospace`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sanity.md:79
msgid ""
"**Fallback / CJK**: `Helvetica`, fallback: `Arial, Hiragino Sans GB, "
"STXihei, Microsoft YaHei, WenQuanYi Micro Hei`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sanity.md:81
msgid ""
"*Note: waldenburgNormal is a custom typeface. For external "
"implementations, use Inter or Space Grotesk as the sans substitute "
"(geometric, slightly condensed feel). IBM Plex Mono is available on "
"Google Fonts.*"
msgstr ""

