#: ../../source/templates_sanity.md:250
msgid "Whitespace Philosophy"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sanity.md:251
msgid ""
"Sanity uses aggressive vertical spacing between sections (64-120px) to "
"create breathing room on the dark canvas. Within sections, spacing is "
"tighter (16-32px), creating dense information clusters separated by "
"generous voids. This rhythm gives the page a \"slides\" quality -- each "
"section feels like its own focused frame."
msgstr ""

