#: ../../source/templates_sanity.md:274
msgid "Depth Philosophy"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sanity.md:275
msgid ""
"Sanity's depth system is almost entirely **colorimetric** rather than "
"shadow-based. Elevation is communicated through surface color shifts: "
"`#0b0b0b` (ground) -> `#212121` (elevated) -> `#353535` (prominent) -> "
"`#ffffff` (inverted/highest). This approach is native to dark interfaces "
"where traditional drop shadows would be invisible. The few shadows that "
"exist are ring-based (0px 0px 0px Npx) or blur-based (backdrop-filter) "
"rather than offset shadows, maintaining the flat, precision-engineered "
"aesthetic."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sanity.md:277
msgid ""
"Border-based containment (1px solid `#212121` or `#353535`) serves as the"
" primary spatial separator, with the border darkness calibrated to be "
"visible but not dominant. The system avoids \"floating card\" aesthetics "
"-- everything feels mounted to the surface rather than hovering above it."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sanity.md:279
msgid "7. Do's and Don'ts"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sanity.md:281
msgid "Do"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sanity.md:282
msgid ""
"Use the achromatic gray scale as the foundation -- maintain pure neutral "
"discipline with no warm/cool tinting"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sanity.md:283
msgid ""
"Apply Electric Blue (`#0052ef`) consistently as the universal "
"hover/active state across all interactive elements"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sanity.md:284
msgid ""
"Use extreme negative letter-spacing (-2px to -4.48px) on display headings"
" 48px and above"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sanity.md:285
msgid ""
"Keep primary CTAs as full-pill shapes (99999px radius) with the coral-red"
" (`#f36458`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sanity.md:286
msgid ""
"Use IBM Plex Mono uppercase for technical labels, tags, and system "
"metadata"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sanity.md:287
msgid ""
"Communicate depth through surface color (dark-to-light) rather than "
"shadows"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sanity.md:288
msgid "Maintain generous vertical section spacing (64-120px) on the dark canvas"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sanity.md:289
msgid ""
"Use `\"cv01\", \"cv11\", \"cv12\", \"cv13\", \"ss07\"` OpenType features "
"for display typography"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sanity.md:291
msgid "Don't"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sanity.md:292
msgid ""
"Don't introduce warm or cool color tints to the neutral scale -- Sanity's"
" grays are pure achromatic"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sanity.md:293
msgid ""
"Don't use drop shadows for elevation -- dark interfaces demand "
"colorimetric depth"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sanity.md:294
msgid ""
"Don't apply border-radius between 13px and 99998px -- the system jumps "
"from 12px (large card) directly to pill (99999px)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sanity.md:295
msgid ""
"Don't mix the coral-red CTA with the electric blue interactive color in "
"the same element"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sanity.md:296
msgid ""
"Don't use heavy font weights (700+) -- the system maxes out at 600 and "
"only for 11px uppercase labels"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sanity.md:297
msgid ""
"Don't place light text on light surfaces or dark text on dark surfaces "
"without checking the gray-on-gray contrast ratio"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sanity.md:298
msgid ""
"Don't use traditional offset box-shadows -- ring shadows (0 0 0 Npx) or "
"border-based containment only"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sanity.md:299
msgid ""
"Don't break the tight line-height on headings -- 1.00-1.24 is the range, "
"never go to 1.5+ for display text"
msgstr ""

